  <p>
    Laptop at home. Tablet at cafe. Phone on the go. Vault syncs across all devices automatically. Every password
    available everywhere always current.
  </p>
  <p>
    Matters more for remote workers switching devices and locations constantly. Browser password managers trap you in
    one ecosystem. Dedicated managers work everywhere.
  </p>

  <h3>Public WiFi Protection</h3>
  <p>
    Coworking spaces cafes airports. Common remote work spots. Common attack vectors.
  </p>
  <p>
